{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"391","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Genetic Engineering"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You will receive 3 points for solving this problem."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Manao is designing the genetic code for a new type of algae to efficiently produce fuel. Specifically, Manao is focusing on a stretch of DNA that encodes one protein. The stretch of DNA is represented by a string containing only the characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Manao has determined that if the stretch of DNA contains a maximal sequence of consecutive identical nucleotides that is of even length, then the protein will be nonfunctional. For example, consider a protein described by DNA string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GTTAAAG"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". It contains four maximal sequences of consecutive identical nucleotides: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"TT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"AAA"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The protein is nonfunctional because sequence \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"TT"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" has even length."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Manao is trying to obtain a functional protein from the protein he currently has. Manao can insert additional nucleotides into the DNA stretch. Each additional nucleotide is a character from the set {'"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'}. Manao wants to determine the minimum number of insertions necessary to make the DNA encode a functional protein."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input consists of a single line, containing a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Each character of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be from the set {'"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'}."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This problem doesn't have subproblems. You will get 3 points for the correct submission."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The program should print on one line a single integer representing the minimum number of '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' characters that are required to be inserted into the input string in order to make all runs of identical characters have odd length."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"GTTAAAG\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"AACCAACCAAAAC\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, it is sufficient to insert a single nucleotide of any type between the two '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"T"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'s in the sequence to restore the functionality of the protein."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"391A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/391/problem/A"}